    {
      "name": "get_context_bundle",
      "description": "Select knowledge for a substantial DST engineering task. For code review or native API research use projection=reviewer, view=decision and normally budget=normal. Packs whole original atoms with required Scope and evidence within the total budget; inspect gaps and expand selected IDs. metadata_ref and metadata_template resolve in the card shared_metadata table. mode changes task priorities; projection controls admission.",
